{
	"info": {
		"name": "Willy's Backend - Discounts API",
		"description": "Complete API documentation for the Discounts management system. Discounts can be percentage-based, fixed amount, buy-x-get-y, or free item promotions.\n\n## Authentication\nAdmin endpoints require JWT authentication with admin role. User endpoints require JWT authentication.\n\n## Base URLs\n- Admin: `{{base_url}}/api/v1/admin/discounts`\n- User: `{{base_url}}/api/v1/discounts`\n\n## Discount Types\n- `PERCENTAGE`: Percentage-based discount (0-100)\n- `FIXED_AMOUNT`: Fixed amount reduction\n- `BUY_X_GET_Y`: Buy X quantity get Y free\n- `FREE_ITEM`: Free item promotion\n\n## Discount Status\n- `ACTIVE`: Currently active discount\n- `INACTIVE`: Disabled discount\n- `SCHEDULED`: Planned for future\n- `EXPIRED`: Validity period has ended\n\n## Target Types\n- `USER`: Assigned to specific users\n- `ITEM`: Applied to specific items",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{access_token}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "base_url",
			"value": "http://localhost:3000",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "discount_id",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "user_id",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "item_id",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		}
	],
